  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Road Spring 2004 ran regional tournaments across Japan from 21 March to 4 April 2004, in junior, senior and master leagues: a qualifying round, then a final tournament for the top eight of each league. Everyone who played got Mitsuhiro Arita's Charizard, whose art is also on the English Charizard of EX Dragon, and the top three of each league won the Victory Ring in an acrylic plaque."
